our very decisions will dramatically alter how the game\u2019s intense, branching narrative plays out. You will face moral dilemmas and decide who lives or dies. With thousands of choices and dozens of possible endings, how will you affect the future of Detroit and humanity\u2019s destiny?", "summary": "Detroit: Become Human is an interactive narrative adventure game developed by Quantic Dream and released in 2018. Set in a near-future Detroit where androids serve humans, the story follows three android protagonists\u2014Kara, Connor, and Markus\u2014who shape the city\u2019s fate through their choices. Gameplay combines exploration, dialogue interactions, and quick-time events, with branching storylines and multiple endings. The narrative explores themes of artificial intelligence, freedom, and morality.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 20, "name": "Thriller"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/detroit-become-human--1", "videos": [{"id": 19283, "name": "Demo Trailer", "video_id": "VqFonFg0-cg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VqFonFg0-cg", "title": "Detroit: Become Human - Demo Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VqFonFg0-cg/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 14360, "name": "Paris Games Week 2015 Trailer", "video_id": "Q_HiEpsM1Ic", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q_HiEpsM1Ic", "title": "Detroit: Become Human Paris Games Week 2015 Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Q_HiEpsM1Ic/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 16593, "name": "PGW17 Trailer", "video_id": "homlPr_o7xE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=homlPr_o7xE", "title": "Detroit: Become Human - PGW17 Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/homlPr_o7xE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 14550, "name": "E3 2017 Trailer", "video_id": "jh5JPax1fHw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jh5JPax1fHw", "title": "Detroit: Become Human - E3 2017 Trailer (Official 4K)", "t